  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Financial Management Capacity Strengthening and GIFMIS Expansion to Ghana Health Service through USAID</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the capacity of the Ghana Health Service on financial management and implementation of the Ghana Integrated Financial Management Information System (GIFMIS) from the national to district level. Through USAID&apos;s PROPEL programme and working alongside the broader USAID G2G agreement with the Ghana Health Service, the project will address low health budget execution, lack of evidence-based budget planning and allocation, inadequate financial management capacity and oversight, and support delivery of Ghana&#x2019;s 2022-2026 PFM strategy in the health sector (one of five priority sectors).</narrative>
  </description>
